      "source_type": "X",
      "raw_text": "#WxHistory |\nTyphoon Melor '15 (Nona; originally named Nonoy but changed retroactively due to political reasons) was tracking through the Philippines as a major typhoon. Melor brought destructive winds to Luzon mainly & very heavy rainfall that led to deadly flooding. \n\nOriental Mindoro suffered the worse where many buildings were destroyed, leading to many being homeless. In Metro Manila, travel was greatly affected & many areas had water rising well over 1m. \n\nMelor killed 51 in total & both that name, plus the PAGASA name Nona got booted & were replaced with Cempaka & Nimfa respectively.",
      "cleaned_text": "#WxHistory | Typhoon Melor '15 (Nona; originally named Nonoy but changed retroactively due to political reasons) was tracking through the Philippines as a major typhoon. Melor brought destructive winds to Luzon mainly & very heavy rainfall that led to deadly flooding. Oriental Mindoro suffered the worse where many buildings were destroyed, leading to many being homeless. In Metro Manila, travel was greatly affected & many areas had water rising well over 1m. Melor killed 51 in total & both that name, plus the PAGASA name Nona got booted & were replaced with Cempaka & Nimfa respectively.",
      "english_translation": "#WxHIStoY Typhoon Melor'15 (Nona; orriginally Named Nonoy but retructive due to political rentions) is the tracking throghs as a major typhoon. Melor bromtructructive winds to Luz malinly &very rainfallal thropoursate throd to dethrodog - foo - flefing. Ororfing.",
